# S-26 — Dedication cards and cause updates (#45, #81–#84, #93). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): all as expected.
# T3-26-001032 donate water-for-schools with a dedication (أم خالد, 0559990001, from نورة, template hasanat): card 404
#   card.not_found before payment · dev trigger → DedicationCard SMS "أم خالد، تبرّع نورة عنك في «…». بطاقتك: …/store/card/{22 chars}",
#   dedication sms_status sent + sent_at · #45 → 200 {toName, messageAr/En (template), fromName نورة, product, locale, issuedAt}
#   — no amount field; headers X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow and Cache-Control: private, no-store · unknown / short token → 404
# anonymous order, no sender name → fromName "فاعل خير" on the card and in the SMS (RUL-23)
# #93 resend {toMobile: 0559990022} → 202, SMS to the corrected mobile, audited (to_mobile ***, sms_status); no body → 202
#   (same mobile); bad mobile → 400; unknown id → 404; viewer → 403
# #82 create on water-for-schools with photo, notifyDonors → 201; CauseUpdatePublished → SMS "تحديث من «…»: … {product link}" to the
#   4 distinct paid donors, once each · #83 edit → 200, notifiedAt kept, no second message · #84 delete → 409
#   cause_update.already_notified · private update without notify → not in public #6, listed in #81 (2 rows), delete → 204
#   missing occurredOn / short title → 400 · unknown asset → 400 · viewer: list 200, post 403
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1

### #45 Public card
GET {{base}}/cards/{{cardToken}}

### #81 Updates (staff)
GET {{base}}/admin/products/{{productId}}/updates
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #82 Post update
POST {{base}}/admin/products/{{productId}}/updates
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titleAr":"تم تركيب البرّاد في مدرسة الهجرة الابتدائية — القصيم","titleEn":"Cooler installed at Al-Hijra Primary","assetId":"{{assetId}}","unitsDelivered":1,"occurredOn":"2026-09-02","isPublic":true,"notifyDonors":true}

### #83 Edit update
PUT {{base}}/admin/cause-updates/{{updateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titleAr":"تم تركيب البرّاد — تحديث","occurredOn":"2026-09-02","isPublic":true,"notifyDonors":true,"unitsDelivered":1}

### #84 Delete update
DELETE {{base}}/admin/cause-updates/{{updateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #93 Resend a dedication card
POST {{base}}/admin/dedications/{{dedicationId}}/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"toMobile":"0559990022"}
